(469,NULL,'Use of $v^2 = u^2 + 2as$ (1)\n\nWith $v = 0$ and $a = -5.6$ (1)\n\n$u = 9.2\\,\\text{m s}^{-1}$ (1)\n\n**Or:** Use of $a = \\frac{F}{m}$ and $W = Fs$ (1); use of $E_K = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2$ (1); $u = 9.2\\,\\text{m s}^{-1}$ (1)\n\nExample: $0 = u^2 - 2 \\times 5.6\\,\\text{m s}^{-2} \\times 7.5\\,\\text{m}$, $u = 9.2\\,\\text{m s}^{-1}$','MARK_SCHEME'),
