(474,NULL,'Moment of $3M$ associated with 1 (1)\n\nTakes moments around suspension (1)\n\nCrow at A and owl at B (1)\n\nAlternative scheme for MP2 and MP3: Show that, without the extra birds, it balances (1); so added birds must be crow at A and owl at B, as in part (i) (1)\n\nExample: $3M \\times 1 + x \\times 2 = M \\times 3 + y \\times 1$, so $2x = y$; $y$ must be an owl and $x$ the crow','MARK_SCHEME'),
