(556,NULL,'From $5\\,\\text{s}$ to $6.5\\,\\text{s}$ lift accelerates upwards **and** from $6.5\\,\\text{s}$ to $27.5\\,\\text{s}$ lift travels upwards at constant speed **and** from $27.5\\,\\text{s}$ to $29\\,\\text{s}$ lift decelerates to rest (1)\n\n**MAX 2 from:**\n\nFrom $5\\,\\text{s}$ to $6.5\\,\\text{s}$ there is resultant force upward **or** tension is greater than the weight (1)\n\nFrom $6.5\\,\\text{s}$ to $27.5\\,\\text{s}$ resultant force is zero **or** tension is equal to weight (1)\n\nFrom $27.5\\,\\text{s}$ to $29\\,\\text{s}$ resultant force is downwards **or** tension is less than weight (1)','MARK_SCHEME'),
