(567,NULL,'EITHER\nUse of $F = ma$ (1)\n\nUse of $v^2 = u^2 + 2as$ (1)\n\n$u = 0.58\\,\\text{m s}^{-1}$ (1)\n\nOR\nUse of $\\Delta W = F\\Delta s$ (1)\n\nUse of $E_k = \\frac{1}{2}mv^2$ (1)\n\n$u = 0.58\\,\\text{m s}^{-1}$ (1)\n\nExample: $-2.2\\times10^{-3} = 0.0085a$, $a = -0.26\\,\\text{m s}^{-2}$; $0 = u^2 + 2(-0.26)(0.65)$; $u = 0.58\\,\\text{m s}^{-1}$','MARK_SCHEME'),
