(597,NULL,'Use of $V = IR$ (1)\n\nUse of $P = I^2R$ (1)\n\nUse of $P = \\dfrac{E}{t}$ (1)\n\n$E = 320\\,\\text{J}$ (1) [ECF from (a); show that answer gives $323\\,\\text{J}$]\n\nOr: use of $V = IR$ to find $I$ (1); use of $V = IR$ to find terminal pd (1); use of $W = VIt$ (1); $E = 320\\,\\text{J}$ (1)\n\nExample: $I = \\dfrac{9\\,\\text{V}}{(72 + 2.5)\\,\\Omega} = 0.121\\,\\text{A}$; $P = (0.121\\,\\text{A})^2 \\times 72\\,\\Omega = 1.05\\,\\text{W}$; $E = 1.05\\,\\text{W} \\times 300\\,\\text{s} = 316\\,\\text{J}$','MARK_SCHEME'),
