(601,NULL,'Use of $A = \\pi r^2$ (1)\n\nUse of $R = \\dfrac{\\rho l}{A}$ (1)\n\n$\\rho = 6.9 \\times 10^{-7}\\,(\\Omega\\,\\text{m})$, so wire is made from stainless steel (1)\n\nExample: $A = \\pi\\left(\\dfrac{1.42 \\times 10^{-3}\\,\\text{m}}{2}\\right)^2 = 1.58 \\times 10^{-6}\\,\\text{m}^2$; $\\rho = \\dfrac{0.72\\,\\Omega \\times 1.58 \\times 10^{-6}\\,\\text{m}^2}{1.65\\,\\text{m}} = 6.9 \\times 10^{-7}\\,\\Omega\\,\\text{m}$','MARK_SCHEME'),
