(603,NULL,'Use of $p = mv$ (1)\n\nUse of momentum conservation (1)\n\n$v = 4.1\\,\\text{m s}^{-1}$ (1)\n\nExample: $p_i = (66 + 52)\\,\\text{kg} \\times 5.6\\,\\text{m s}^{-1}$; $p_f = (66\\,\\text{kg})v + (52\\,\\text{kg} \\times 7.5\\,\\text{m s}^{-1})$; $v = \\dfrac{(661 - 390)\\,\\text{kg m s}^{-1}}{66\\,\\text{kg}} = 4.11\\,\\text{m s}^{-1}$','MARK_SCHEME'),
